# Send only the web project to the builder; omit repository documents and raw data.
**
!src/
!src/StakeholderConsultations.Web/
!src/StakeholderConsultations.Web/**

# Never copy host build output or local credentials into a build layer.
**/bin
**/obj
**/Properties
**/.env*
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
